              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cindy C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I just tried this a few weeks ago for the first time. Very good and very easy. I didn't peel the yams, scrubbed them good instead. I drizzeled with olive oil and then the salt and pepper."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
