            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Crystal S"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Brown sugar is the key to this recipe. You can definitely be heart healthy and cook per the recipe, but to achieve the best taste, add a little brown sugar and cinnamon. Great way to serve a different version of yams. Thank you Foxy!",
            "datePublished": "2015-07-12T20:19:31.180Z"
          },
          {
